# PHYML's model struct and everything hanging off it, allocated once per run
# when --tstv estimates kappa.  Free_Model() is the matching call but it
# crashes here: the model is entangled with structures Free_Tree_Lk has
# already released.  One shot, about 3.4 kB, --tstv only.
#
# This excuses leaks anywhere under treeML(), so a new leak introduced in the
# kappa estimation path would not be caught.  Memory errors there still are:
# only Memcheck:Leak is suppressed.
{
   phyml_allocations_under_treeML
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite,indirect
   fun:calloc
   fun:mCalloc
   ...
   fun:treeML
}
